            <h3>Meal & Beverage Options</h3>
            <p>Given the roughly five-and-a-half-hour crossing, in-flight service varies significantly by carrier. JetBlue provides complimentary snacks, soft drinks, and Dunkin' coffee, with fresh meal boxes available for purchase. Alaska offers complimentary snacks and beverages with buy-on-board fresh items. Southwest serves complimentary snacks and soft drinks. Delta and American offer complimentary snacks and beverages with fresh food for purchase on longer routes. Packing your own food remains a smart move for dietary preferences or longer travel days.</p>
            <h3>Comfort & Amenities</h3>
